WEBVTT

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:08.790
Where?

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:13.690
I remember...

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:40.650
I remember I was about to use
the Giga Slave on Darkstar...

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.390
And then...

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:45.120
Where's Gourry?
And Amelia and the others?

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:48.430
WHA?! What the heck
is up with these clothes?!

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.160
Ow...

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:55.360
What's going on here?
Besides that...

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:58.410
WHERE AM I?!

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:15.760
Oh, it's hard to walk.
These heels are so high.

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:19.130
Oh... I feel like
I'm gonna tip over.

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:23.150
Lina, talking to yourself
this much isn't a good sign.

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:26.730
Yeah, but I'm lonely
with nobody else around.

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.860
Hold it! But then why?!

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.110
SOMEbody must have
taken off my clothes...

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.200
...and then dressed me like this!

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:39.180
Why, that!!! Looking at a
girl's body when she's!!!

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.270
GI MME MY CLOTHES BACK!!!

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:48.290
No time to get distracted.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:51.490
I've gotta find
Gourry and the others.

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:55.930
But which way am
I supposed to go?!

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:05.470
What the?

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:12.040
Hup-two! Hup-two!
Hup-two! Hup-two!

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:17.210
Um, I need some directions, so...

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:22.820
Hey, where are you guys going?

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:30.800
Look, I just need you
to tell me something.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:31.890
Where am I?

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:35.700
I guess you don't understand
what I'm asking, right?

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:36.700
What the?!

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:47.810
Oh, my...

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.350
Don't bother us
when we're marching!

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.750
Ow! What's the big idea?!

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:21.680
Now what?! What the heck's
going on around here?!

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.820
Welcome to the
Dimensional Labyrinth!

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:31.220
Who's there?!

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:35.090
A... A PIG?!
And he's pink, to boot.

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:41.100
Okay, it's a cliched way to check,
but I'm definitely not dreaming.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:47.000
My name is Pig. A guide who
wanders the space between worlds.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.840
Come, please.
I'll show you around.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:51.540
Oh, thanks, I appreciate it...

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:53.810
No, hold it!
What's going on here?!

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:56.250
Why was I chased
into this screwy trap?!

00:05:58.050 --> 00:05:59.820
Didn't I just tell you?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:05.260
This is a labyrinth where
endless dimensions intersect.

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:10.260
Oh, this poor beast man.
He's obviously lost his mind.

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.830
Now, then, to which world
do you wish to go?

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:18.770
My master instructed
me to guide our guests.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:24.240
Um, well... Sorry, but I
don't have time to fool around.

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:26.210
I've gotta find
my friends, and fast!

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.910
Um, anyway... Be seeing you!

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:38.720
What the heck
is THIS all about?!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.460
It can't be helped.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:44.020
You cannot resist the
Roulette Wheel of Fate.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:46.730
Stop it! STOP!!!

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.580
Be seeing you!

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:06.210
Where's it taking me?!

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.880
I'M GETTI NG DIZZY!!!

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:20.560
Oh, my! Somebody's set out a
nice roast chicken for me to eat!

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:24.470
Should I? Well, my friends aren't
here, so I'll take it for myself!

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:27.130
DOWN THE HATCH!

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:29.470
OW!!!

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.480
Hey, you mind not
chewing on my breasts?!

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:38.090
You have no table
manners at all, do you?!

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:40.490
Don't you even know how
to use a knife or fork?!

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:46.260
I agree. Especially after we
prepared this lovely feast for her.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.160
It ruins the meal!

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.640
Oh, I totally agree!
And on the other hand...

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.800
...your table manners are
so impeccable, Master Pig!

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.740
It's always a pleasure
to dine with you.

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:00.670
Oh, my. Thank you.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:11.850
Sorry about this, but I prefer
my dinners to not talk to me!

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:15.790
Oh, wait, please!
I'll show you the way!

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:16.620
No, thank you!

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:21.150
Roulette Wheel of Fate, my eye!
You've gotta be kidding...

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:34.570
What the?
What's going on now?!

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:40.220
Maybe I'm going nuts.
Or maybe I've already gone nuts!

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.910
What's this now?! I can't wear
this ridiculous getup!

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:50.720
Yeah, I'm definitely
going nuts.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:53.020
Darn it,
guess I'd better dance.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:55.560
I'll probably end up
flying off to somewhere else.

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:59.390
Whee. I'm dancing. Look at me.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:02.230
Dancing, dancing, just like you.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:06.240
Don't care when
the dance is through.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.970
Gourry! Here you are!

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:25.360
Come on, everyone!
Get the fever! Get the fever!

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:29.560
Pig!

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:34.230
Start making sense! Where am I?!
What world is this?!

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:38.330
I offered to guide
you before, didn't I?

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:42.780
This is the place between worlds.
The Dimensional Labyrinth.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:50.510
Let me tell you a story,
a story from long ago.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:55.790
Once upon a time, there was an evil
demon who wished to destroy this world...

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.220
...and brave heroes
who saved the world.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:03.360
The demon and the heroes
fought for the fate of the world.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.800
Do you mean?!

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:15.070
Both sides met in a
battle to the death.

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:20.840
But that terrible battle
disrupted the dimensions...

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:23.940
...and caused this
mad world to be born.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.550
Do you understand now?

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:31.560
Then answer me straight!
Where exactly do you want to take me?!

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:34.820
If you wish to go to a
pleasant world, I can take you.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:37.730
Now, where do
you want to go?

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:40.130
Where?
Where do you think?!

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:44.240
Don't tell me...

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.610
Don't interrupt our dance!

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:52.310
Oh, I'm really
getting sick of this!

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:53.680
Cut it out!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.260
Ew... Bad taste.

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:28.370
It's bad taste
to say such things.

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:30.470
- Listen, you...
- Be silent.

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:33.100
Stop making a fool of me!

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:40.680
In the end, all must
eventually end up here.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:46.580
Where do people come from,
and where do they go?

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:50.250
Leave those little nagging
questions to some other series!

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:52.290
There's only one
thing I want to know!

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:53.350
LEVITATION!

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:57.930
And that's how I can
bust out of this world!

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:01.830
A funeral procession
is passing by.

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.970
Hey! Are you all right?

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:13.770
A- Again?

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:20.240
DON'T I NTERRUPT OUR FUNERAL!

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:24.690
Um, but I didn't
do anything! Right?

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.230
Rest in peace...

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:47.770
Where am I?

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:52.610
Hold it...
Was everything up till now...

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:54.580
...a dream?

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.900
This is all...

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:19.810
Well, I'll be damned...

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:27.950
So, I've just been running
around being scared by puppets.

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:39.160
Now I'm REALLY mad!

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:47.340
I'm not a stupid puppet!
I won't let anyone pull MY strings!

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:52.740
My master instructed
me to guide our guests.

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:56.840
That's right. Puppets don't
move by themselves.

00:13:57.520 --> 00:14:00.140
When the puppet master isn't
controlling them, at least.

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:01.550
DAMU BRAS!

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:11.490
I dunno who's behind this, but I
think it's time I gave him a hello!

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.560
A really PAI NFUL hello!

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:17.430
Isn't it wonderful?
Have you heard the news?

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:21.370
The king will be appearing
at the ball tonight!

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:28.050
Jeez, it's like a nightmare!

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:30.870
Did you know it would be a
formal tea party this time?

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:34.040
Oh, and what about all this?

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:35.480
Oh, yes, I quite agree.

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:38.990
Lousy taste.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.860
FLARE ARROW!

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:04.880
Sorry to cause a ruckus, "Master,"
but we need to talk about stuff.

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:07.020
I know this is sort of rude...

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:09.880
...but these tricks you're
playing are just as rude.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.920
Say something, you big oaf!

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:17.390
YOU?!

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.130
Zelgadis?!

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.430
What are you?
Why are you here?!

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.870
YOU'VE been
controlling everyone?!

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:28.440
Zel?

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:30.900
What's wrong with you?!

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:33.840
Hey, what's the
matter, Zel?! Zelgadis!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:41.250
Heh-heh-heh...
You cute little...

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:44.980
"You cute little" WHAT,
you stupid!!!

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:47.390
How dare you have a
nice dream by yourself!

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:54.360
Lina? Oh, you're here, too?

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:58.500
- Don't just give me that!
- Can't... breathe...

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:00.270
What's been going on here?!

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:04.670
You've been playing king while I had
to wander around in this nutty world?!

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:08.010
Do you know what I had to
go through to get here?!

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.380
H- Hold it! I was just
tired and fell asleep.

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:11.940
Don't jump to conclusions!

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:14.490
Jump to conclusions?!

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:20.720
What the...

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.560
A ball.
It's the third one.

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:25.530
Third one? Zel?

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:29.360
It looks like I got
here before you did.

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:33.130
I've been stumbling
around in this world.

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:35.610
You must have
had a tough time, too.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:40.570
But no matter what I try, I keep
coming back to this mad ball.

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:42.940
Huh? Then you're
saying this world is?

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:46.340
It's clear that someone is
controlling where we go here.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:49.780
You mean... This world's master.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.690
Were you enjoying yourselves?

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:04.160
Pig!

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:09.700
If you didn't enjoy it,
we can try again.

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:10.900
What?!

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:13.210
Pig... I see now.

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:15.050
Of course!

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:17.710
FLARE ARROW!

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:25.320
Oh? And just what
is this all about?

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:29.790
Thought so. Your puppets
didn't show up everywhere.

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:32.160
Which means the
guide for this world...

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.790
...is also its master, isn't it?

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:38.130
Did you both enjoy yourselves?

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:41.200
Yeah, I guess so.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:47.350
Well, well... Now where
do you wish me to take you?

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:50.070
Where do you think?!
Take us back to our world!

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:52.380
Oh? To "Our" world?

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:57.310
Oh, dear. Oh, dear.
I've no idea how to do that.

00:17:57.560 --> 00:18:00.020
Oh, well, then.

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:05.030
I guess we'll just have
to make our own path.

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:08.190
Whoa, Lina! Calm down!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.940
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows."

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:15.440
"Buried in the flow of time..."

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:17.530
"In thy great name!"

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:19.030
Lina, cut it out!

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:22.440
We don't know what firing
a Dragon Slave here will do!

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:25.640
"...by the power
you and I possess!"

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:29.540
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:38.050
Don't be stupid!

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:41.570
Ooh, but I was so-o-o mad!

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:45.540
If I didn't take a one itsy-bitsy
shot, I couldn't live with myself!

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:47.300
Knock off the cute act!

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:06.790
Another world?

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:11.090
Oh, jeez! I'm not gonna think
twice about blowing this place up!

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:13.360
Miss Lina! Mr. Zelgadis!

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:15.200
Huh? That voice!

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:19.000
I knew it! You two were
on this island, too!

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:23.030
I thought you were guests
who knew what was going on.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:26.340
So, you both really were lost.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:31.180
Guess we'll have to shut this
attraction down for a while.

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:33.210
Attraction?

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:38.190
This island is the latest and most
popular attraction theme park!

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:42.290
A fantasy island where they take
you on a journey to other worlds!

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:45.860
Here are your clothes
we were storing for you.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:50.760
I'm so glad. I was starting to think
I was the only one who made it.

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:53.630
Oh, and those costumes
look great on you!

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:55.430
Miss Lina looks adorable
in that outfit...

00:19:55.510 --> 00:20:00.440
...and Mr. Zelgadis looks like a
gallant prince who's come to save her.

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:04.040
Still, the fact I was able
to find you so quickly...

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:06.880
...should prove that you should
trust me when I make predictions.

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:09.920
Filia... By the way,
what are those tickets?

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.150
Um, well, you see...

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:16.560
I figured I could have a good
time looking for you all.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.260
After all the
stress I've been under...

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:23.700
...I was wondering if I could
remember how to have fun.

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:26.240
Oh, yes.
Here's a souvenir for you.

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:28.200
WHAT is THIS?

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:31.410
Oh, one of these
popular little pig dolls.

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:33.140
Didn't you meet him inside?

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:36.070
There's the bunny girl one,
and the tuxedo one...

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:38.580
...the casino dealer one,
the cleaning lady one...

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:42.520
...the bikini one,
and all the others, too!

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:46.080
Isn't it just the
cutest thing? Isn't it?

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:50.260
NO, IT'S NOT CUTE AT ALL!!!

00:20:57.740 --> 00:21:01.000
Hey, who took my clothes
off in the first place?

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:04.010
Who? C'mon, tell me! WHO?!

00:22:22.490 --> 00:22:24.180
While we look for
Gourry and the others...

00:22:24.260 --> 00:22:25.920
...we set sail on a
suspicious-looking ship.

00:22:26.060 --> 00:22:27.850
What's going on here?!
Huh? Ajar?

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:31.690
Next time, " Pandemonium!
Terror of the Cursed Jar!"

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:34.460
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
